{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DorvRC7Tbi7VVYT6GvuxVM","type":"tool_result","content":"51:  cash: E.sprite(['GGGGGG', 'GgWWgG', 'GWggWG', 'GgWWgG', 'GGGGGG'], { G: '#2e8a3a', g: '#5ac060', W: '#e8f8d0' }),\n52:  envelope: E.sprite(['WWWWWWWW', 'WwWWWWwW', 'WWwWWwWW', 'WWWwwWWW', 'WWWWWWWW'], { W: '#f0e8d0', w: '#a89878' }),\n169:- `E.mix(h1, h2, t)`: the color t of the way from h1 to h2 ('#rrggbb')\n181:- `E.shade(h, a)`: shade('#336699', -0.3) darker, (+0.3) lighter. Hue-shifted like painted pixel art: darker drifts cool, lighter drifts warm\n190:- `E.tones(c, strength = 1)`: five shades of a color for painted-looking pixel art: { deep, sh, base, lt, hi }. Shadows drift toward blue-violet, highlights toward warm yellow (strength 0..2, default 1).\n244:- `E.charView(view)`: the view a rig in `view` is drawn from (the sprite-like angle above; the view itself outside pitch 40-89)\n424:- `r.marker(x, y, z = 0, o = {})`: an objective marker over a world point: a bobbing diamond (and its label) while it is on screen, an arrow at the screen's edge pointing to it while it is off (offscreen: false hides it then). o: { label, color: '#ffd040', offscreen: 'arrow' }\n429:- `r.shadow(x, y, rad, alpha = .5, color = '#0c0818', z = 0)`: soft contact shadow under a character: a cached dithered ellipse, correct for the current view. z = height of the surface it falls on (0 = floor; the top of a block or platform otherwise)\n440:- `r.w(x, y, z = 0)`: world -> buffer pixel coords","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70b9b3fb-a482-4430-a756-95fe6fe59945","uuid":"4b3200b6-de28-487a-ac52-23c92e808c77","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:23:05.604Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"51:  cash: E.sprite(['GGGGGG', 'GgWWgG', 'GWggWG', 'GgWWgG', 'GGGGGG'], { G: '#2e8a3a', g: '#5ac060', W: '#e8f8d0' }),\n52:  envelope: E.sprite(['WWWWWWWW', 'WwWWWWwW', 'WWwWWwWW', 'WWWwwWWW', 'WWWWWWWW'], { W: '#f0e8d0', w: '#a89878' }),\n169:- `E.mix(h1, 