-in prompt widget that draws the right glyph for the last device.']],","+  ['PROMPT FEEDBACK', [","+    'Liked: the freedom to pick the genre, so Mad Men could be a game about talking and pitching instead of a shooter.',","+    'Confusing: the multiplayer line asks for AI Hub integration and multiplayer for the game on its own; local hot seat was my reading of the second.',","+    'Hardest: fitting attract mode, local versus, AI Hub and a three-day story into one vertical slice.',","+    'One more test: a real DualSense on a real TV at ten feet, to judge text size and glyphs.']],","   ['CREDITS', ['Design, writing, code, music and sound: Claude (Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5) for the cc-matrix run.', 'Engine: my-3D2dge by Michael Crosato. Session client: AI Hub.', 'Thanks to the Sterling Cooper of our imaginations. No accounts were harmed.']]"," ];"," })();"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-181337__x3ec78e/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":847,"oldLines":3,"newStart":847,"newLines":7,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":350,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":200,\"session_id\":\"45e6dbf6-73de-492d-a24c-c1459c8eed93\",\"uuid\":\"2764e2c3-9d1f-41b0-8e52-b203d2096145\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":500,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"45e6dbf6-73de-492d-a24c-c1459c8eed93\",\"uuid\":\"f64dd22d-224f-4ef2-ade3-e083d60281ce\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CgfAFgnLTVZb1TNgRCiNi\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":733,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":327162,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":733,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"outp